and the complete index is available at https://grafana.com/llms-full.txt.</p><div class="grid-layout docs" x-data=app_mobile() x-init="() => init()"><section id=mobile class="mobile print-hidden"><div class=mobile__wrapper><button class=mobile__nav @click.prevent="toggle_menu('nav')">
